10. In respect of said contentions, the learned counsel appearing on behalf of the respondent cited the judgment of this Court in the case of Zulaiha Syed Mohideen Vs.
D.Visalakshi Ammal & Others reported in MANU/TN/2222/2013, wherein the Court made following observations;
5.Before going into the merits of the case, first of https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis C.M.P.No.6196 of 2021 and A.S.Sr.No.1454 of 2021 & etc., batch all, it should be stated that in a case of this nature for condonation of delay, it is well settled that length of delay is not material, but the reasons stated thereof for condonation of delay.
